      "text": "Abram went down into Egypt to sojourn, Gen. 12:10 (Abr. 2:21). fellow came in to sojourn, Gen. 19:9. Sojourn in this land, Gen. 26:3. to sojourn in the land are we come, Gen. 47:4. sojourning of the children of Israel, who dwelt in Egypt, Ex. 12:40. I go to sojourn where I may find a place, Judg. 17:9. Jacob sojourned in the land of Ham, Ps. 105:23. My people went … into Egypt to sojourn there, Isa. 52:4.",
